<section class="section dark" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">From discovery to delivery</div>
        <h2>
          A clear path.
          <br />
          No leap of faith.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        A hands-on partnership, with the scope and commercial terms agreed
        before any data is licensed.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <article class="step">
        <div class="step-num">01 /</div>
        <h3>Find the opportunity</h3>
        <p>
          Map your systems, data history, and licensing rights. Identify where
          your records could fit AI training or evaluation needs.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="step">
        <div class="step-num">02 /</div>
        <h3>Set your boundaries</h3>
        <p>
          Define what’s included, what stays out, permitted uses, and the
          commercial structure. Review the proposed license before moving
          forward.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="step">
        <div class="step-num">03 /</div>
        <h3>Prepare with care</h3>
        <p>
          Agree on a transfer method, remove or transform sensitive fields, and
          check dataset quality against the approved scope.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="step">
        <div class="step-num">04 /</div>
        <h3>License. Earn. Repeat.</h3>
        <p>
          Deliver under signed terms and receive payment as agreed. Explore
          future licenses or updates only where your agreement permits.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="process-foot">
      <a class="btn light" href="#contact">
        Explore your opportunity <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
